{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6f16eb55bd06110ebf482745257876f13ccbc2a5c16702347cc8867a2181fd72","ja":"……ふー、お腹いっぱい。もう動けないよ～♪","zh":"……呼——，肚子饱饱的。已经动不了了～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4bed9196382878e82d92322cf0137405476031be8fd2de5026f16fff89bba586","ja":"ねえ、響ちゃんは全然食べてなかったよね？\n体調でも悪いの？　大丈夫……？","zh":"呐，小响完全没吃吧？\n是身体不舒服吗？没事吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"24709844165784fbaaadcd126750fc929db905ec971aa148902bd482fb7d5f2c","ja":"み、美奈子……。\nだ、大丈夫だぞ！　自分は元気一杯さー！","zh":"美、美奈子……。\n没、没事的！　我精神好得很啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f848b24fc7b01911b9f9ccf4fdd90e12a0ecd4a42a1e8090e419a877facb437a","ja":"（自分の考え、間違ってるのかな？　いやでも……\n勝つためには手段なんて選んでられないさー！）","zh":"（自己的想法，是不是错了？　不，可是……\n为了赢，手段什么的根本由不得我挑啊——！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e8cff842bdf8e320c0dca4f109143b5f3719a676135a3a66b7ffc60e3e5590d6","ja":"（卑怯だとか、みんなに悪いとか、\nそんな甘い考えは捨てなきゃ！）","zh":"（卑鄙也好，对不起大家也好，\n那种天真的想法必须抛开！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"eedd0a8daa7cb1e5035f3f8a1766ca29d9e9723429de89030f80e00c8792e499","ja":"この杏仁豆腐、すっごく美味しい！　外でみんなと\n食べると楽しいし……響さんのおかげだね！","zh":"这个杏仁豆腐，超级好吃！　在外面和大家\n一起吃很开心……多亏了响啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"313112738998fc590db90c03502f0b6fa7ae0b468fb485b7aa8fa0459b430003","ja":"うん♪　響ちゃん、きょ、今日はなにからなにまで、\n本当にありがとう……。","zh":"嗯♪　小响，今、今天从头到尾，\n真的谢谢你……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3bea561ba32310d3f942b3a0e7c2c99599cde36fdfa8f97102e658cf56aff7e4","ja":"うんうん。響、本当にありがとうな！　アタシ達からも\nなんか響に恩返しできればいいけど……。","zh":"嗯嗯。响，真的谢谢你！我们也\n希望能回报响……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_950.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a0158fa61399e5878714de1284c1414b4d551eed3d2f10f67f02baac1a19745c","ja":"うっ……！　お、恩返しなんて……。","zh":"呜……！　啊，报恩什么的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
